Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Excel, PowerPoint, and SharePoint, including the ability to create advance-level presentations, dashboards, charts, and management summaries;
Ability to liaise effectively with multiple stakeholders;
Strong stakeholder engagement and consensus-building skills;
Ability to translate complex information into clear and concise reports for management audiences;
